    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Implemented Developer Mode as a global Lexeditor setting. When enabled, GitHub and Restart appear in the active game's top command row immediately before the Windows controls. GitHub still requires an authorized repository account. Restart replaces only the active plugin service in the same window and offers Save and Restart, Restart Without Saving, or Cancel when edits are unsaved. Settings persistence, restart lifecycle, hidden host checks, and the rendered placement check passed. Please inspect the controls and restart behavior.",
